{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03222","headline":"温泉庄卧病寄杨七炯 · 宋之问","name":"温泉庄卧病寄杨七炯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"移疾卧兹岭，寥寥倦幽独。\n赖有嵩丘山，高枕长在目。\n兹山栖灵异，朝夜翳云族。\n是日蒙雨晴，返景入岩谷。\n幂幂涧畔草，青青山下木。\n此意方无穷，环顾怅林麓。\n伊洛何悠漫，川原信重复。\n夏余鸟兽蕃，秋末禾黍熟。\n秉愿守樊圃，归闲欣艺牧。\n惜无载酒人，徒把凉泉掬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03222.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03222","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}